            "demoAccountName": null,
            "demoAccountPassword": null,
            "demoAccountRequired": false,
            "notes": "Hello App Review Team,\r\r\n\r\r\nThank you for the Guideline 2.3.10 feedback on Qwertymates 1.0 (8) (Submission 5348e907-c57f-45af-9f69-c3bda9351276).\r\r\n\r\r\nGUIDELINE 2.3.10 — Accurate Metadata (screenshots)\r\r\nWe revised App Store screenshots across iPhone 6.7\", 6.5\", 5.5\" and iPad sizes:\r\r\n\r\r\n• Removed non-iOS / Android status bar images (time, dual signal, circular battery %) that previously appeared inside marketing screenshots (including under “Statuses, posts & creators”).\r\r\n• Revised screenshots now show product UI without Android OS chrome, so they accurately reflect the app on supported iOS devices and highlight main features: Your Wall, QwertyHub, QwertyTV, Explore, and ACBPay Wallet.\r\r\n• Wallet caption uses spaced “ACBPay Wallet” (not a compound / garbled third-party-looking label).\r\r\n\r\r\nThis is a metadata-only fix. The same binary build 8 remains attached.\r\r\n\r\r\nApp access: Reviewers can register with any email on Sign Up. Production API: https://api.qwertymates.com. Support: administrator@qwertymates.com.\r\r\n\r\r\nThank you,\r\r\nQwertymates Team"
          }
